# Comprehensive Walkthrough: IndiaHRMS Payroll Module

This walkthrough provides a complete overview of what has been achieved in the **Payroll Module** of `IndiaHRMS` and details the exact feature capabilities accessible across different **User Roles** (Employee Self-Service, Payroll/HR Admin, and Super Admin).

---

## 1. What Has Been Achieved

We have established a production-ready, Indian statutory-compliant Payroll system covering end-to-end salary calculations, monthly execution workflows, CTC revisions, IT tax declarations, statutory compliance reporting, and PDF payslip downloads.

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                       PAYROLL MODULE ARCHITECTURE                           │
├──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────┤
│ STATUTORY ENGINE         │ EXECUTION & WORKFLOW     │ EMPLOYEE SELF-SERVICE │
├──────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────┤
│ ✔ EPF (EPF Act 1952)     │ ✔ Monthly Batch Process  │ ✔ My Salary Slips     │
│ ✔ ESI (ESI Act 1948)     │ ✔ Approval Workflow      │ ✔ QuestPDF Download   │
│ ✔ PT (State-wise Slabs)  │ ✔ Disbursement Status    │ ✔ IT Tax Declaration  │
│ ✔ TDS (New & Old Regime) │ ✔ Component & Structure  │ ✔ CTC Revision View   │
│ ✔ YTD TDS Accumulation   │ ✔ Compliance Reports     │ ✔ HTML Browser Print  │
└──────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────┴───────────────────────┘
```

### Key Engineering & Functional Milestone Achievements:

1. **Server-Side PDF Payslip Generation Engine (TICKET-1)**:
   - Built a QuestPDF document renderer ([PdfService.cs](file:///d:/hhrrmmsss/IndiaHRMS/backend/src/IndiaHRMS.Infrastructure/Services/PdfService.cs)) producing professional Indian payslips with company letterhead, employee details grid, itemized 2-column earnings & deductions tables, net payable summary box, and an English words amount converter.
   - Exposed API endpoint `GET /api/payroll/salary-slips/{employeeId}/{year}/{month}/pdf`.
   - Added instant PDF downloading in [SalarySlipPage.tsx](file:///d:/hhrrmmsss/IndiaHRMS/frontend/src/pages/payroll/SalarySlipPage.tsx).

2. **Full Salary Component & Structure Configuration CRUD (TICKET-2)**:
   - Built backend API endpoints in [PayrollController.cs](file:///d:/hhrrmmsss/IndiaHRMS/backend/src/IndiaHRMS.API/Controllers/PayrollController.cs#L330-L435) for creating & updating salary components and structure templates.
   - Created interactive Ant Design modal interfaces in [SalaryStructurePage.tsx](file:///d:/hhrrmmsss/IndiaHRMS/frontend/src/pages/payroll/SalaryStructurePage.tsx) allowing admins to define custom earnings, deductions, statutory flags, and structure templates.

3. **Cumulative YTD TDS Tracking & Dynamic Tax Engine (TICKET-3)**:
   - Upgraded `ProcessPayroll` in [PayrollController.cs](file:///d:/hhrrmmsss/IndiaHRMS/backend/src/IndiaHRMS.API/Controllers/PayrollController.cs#L117-L137) to calculate the Indian Financial Year cycle (April 1 – March 31).
   - Aggregates prior YTD `TDSDeducted` across previous processed months and dynamically computes remaining monthly TDS liability over `RemainingMonthsInFY`.

4. **Indian Statutory Compliance Engine**:
   - Supports EPF Act 1952 (capped at ₹15,000 ceiling @ 12%), ESI Act 1948 (capped at ₹21,000 ceiling @ 0.75%/3.25%), Professional Tax across 6 states (Maharashtra, Karnataka, West Bengal, Telangana, Andhra Pradesh, Tamil Nadu), LWF, Gratuity provisions, and Loss of Pay (LWP) attendance deductions.

