### Role 1: Employee (Self-Service Role)

The **Employee** role provides self-service access to individual compensation documents, investment declarations, and personal pay history while restricting visibility of other employees' financial data.

| Feature / Module | API Endpoint & Authorization | Screen / Page UI | What the Employee Can Do | Security & Access Rule |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **My Salary Slips** | `GET /api/payroll/my-salary-slips` | [SalarySlipPage.tsx](file:///d:/hhrrmmsss/IndiaHRMS/frontend/src/pages/payroll/SalarySlipPage.tsx) | View a list of all disbursed monthly salary slips with gross earnings, total deductions, and net pay. | Shows **only** disbursed slips belonging to the logged-in employee ID. |
| **Server-Side PDF Payslip Download** | `GET /api/payroll/salary-slips/{empId}/{yr}/{m}/pdf` | [SalarySlipPage.tsx](file:///d:/hhrrmmsss/IndiaHRMS/frontend/src/pages/payroll/SalarySlipPage.tsx#L39-L59) | Download an officially formatted QuestPDF document (`Payslip_EMP001_Jul_2026.pdf`) for record keeping and loan applications. | Endpoint checks `_cu.EmployeeId == employeeId`. Blocks downloading other employees' slips. |
| **Browser Payslip Printing** | N/A (Frontend Render) | [SalarySlipPage.tsx](file:///d:/hhrrmmsss/IndiaHRMS/frontend/src/pages/payroll/SalarySlipPage.tsx#L140-L185) | Preview itemized earnings (Basic, HRA, Special Allowance) & statutory deductions (EPF, ESI, PT, TDS, LWF) in a clean modal and trigger browser printing (`window.print()`). | Displayed inside an Ant Design modal with company header details. |
| **IT Tax Declaration Portal** | `GET /api/payroll/tax-declaration/{empId}/{fy}`<br/>`POST /api/payroll/tax-declaration` | [TaxDeclarationPage.tsx](file:///d:/hhrrmmsss/IndiaHRMS/frontend/src/pages/payroll/TaxDeclarationPage.tsx) | Select financial year (`2025-26`, `2026-27`), opt for **New Tax Regime** (Section 115BAC) or **Old Tax Regime**, and submit claims for Section 80C (up to ₹1.5L), Section 80D, HRA Rent, and 24(b) Home Loan Interest. | Can view and submit tax declarations **only for their own employee profile**. |
| **Personal Compensation Details** | `GET /api/payroll/salary/{empId}` | [CtcRevisionPage.tsx](file:///d:/hhrrmmsss/IndiaHRMS/frontend/src/pages/payroll/CtcRevisionPage.tsx) | View current active Gross CTC, Basic Salary, effective dates, and past salary increment history. | Employee can only view their own compensation record. Cannot revise salary. |

